        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Head cover, fine white cotton, with a plain field and jamdani-like brocade in the corners of the field, a large buta in silver-wrapped thread containing small flower heads in white surrounded by a narrow border of trees in silver-wrapped thread, a wider border of stylised plants in white, and edge borders of silver-wrapped thread in a chevron design, and a central medallion in silver-wrapped thread and white silk thread."@en ;
